---
import { siteConfig } from '../config/site';
import { metrics } from '../data/metrics';
const { hero, tagline } = siteConfig;
---
<section class="grid gap-12 lg:grid-cols-[minmax(0,1fr),380px]">
  <div class="space-y-6">
    <p class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full border border-blue-500/40 bg-blue-500/10 px-4 py-1 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.35em] text-blue-200">
      {hero.eyebrow}
    </p>
    <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold leading-tight text-white md:text-5xl">{hero.title}</h1>
    <p class="text-lg text-slate-300 md:text-xl">{hero.subtitle}</p>
    <p class="text-sm text-slate-400">{tagline}</p>

    <div class="flex flex-col gap-3 sm:flex-row">
      <a
        href={hero.primaryAction.href}
        class="inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-blue-500 px-6 py-3 text-sm font-semibold text-white shadow-lg shadow-blue-500/30 transition hover:-translate-y-0.5 hover:bg-blue-400"
      >
        {hero.primaryAction.label}
      </a>
      <a
        href={hero.secondaryAction.href}
        class="inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-full border border-slate-700 px-6 py-3 text-sm font-semibold text-slate-200 transition hover:border-blue-400 hover:text-blue-200"
      >
        {hero.secondaryAction.label}
      </a>
    </div>

    <div class="grid gap-6 rounded-2xl border border-slate-800 bg-slate-900/60 p-6 shadow shadow-blue-500/10 sm:grid-cols-3">
      {metrics.map(metric => (
        <div class="space-y-1">
          <p class="text-3xl font-semibold text-white">{metric.value}</p>
          <p class="text-sm text-slate-300">{metric.label}</p>
          <p class="text-xs text-slate-500">{metric.detail}</p>
        </div>
      ))}
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="relative rounded-3xl border border-slate-800 bg-gradient-to-br from-slate-900 via-slate-900 to-blue-900/40 p-8 shadow-xl shadow-blue-500/20">
    <div class="space-y-4">
      <p class="text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.35em] text-blue-300">Panel de analíticas</p>
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white">Visualiza oportunidades de monetización</h2>
      <p class="text-sm text-slate-300">
        Dashboards en tiempo real muestran qué herramientas generan más engagement, qué contenidos convierten y qué clientes están listos para un upgrade.
      </p>
      <ul class="space-y-2 text-sm text-slate-300">
        <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
          <span class="mt-1 text-blue-300">✔</span>
          Eventos automáticos: descargas, clics, conversiones.
        </li>
        <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
          <span class="mt-1 text-blue-300">✔</span>
          Segmentación por cliente, curso o cohorte.
        </li>
        <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
          <span class="mt-1 text-blue-300">✔</span>
          Exportación a CSV y conexión con CRM.
        </li>
      </ul>
      <div class="rounded-2xl border border-blue-500/40 bg-blue-500/10 p-4 text-xs text-blue-100">
        <p class="font-semibold">Nuevo en versión PRO</p>
        <p>Mapas de calor y embudos personalizables integrados con Google Analytics 4.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
